        "body": "<!-- proofline:finding-series=01a202cc-e25f-76ce-b336-30b1f7ec051d -->\n**Warning** \u00b7 Report names can split CSV fields or records\n\nThe export joins fields with commas without CSV quoting, even though report names can contain commas, newlines, or leading quotes.\n\nCSV readers can return extra records or misparse fields instead of returning one intact record per delivery.\n\nKeep streaming the query results, but write each row with `csv.writer` so field values are quoted and escaped.\n\n[View finding in Proofline](https://proofline.sh/orgs/by-id/01a202a0-cd61-7684-99bc-53c775b0de50/reviews/01a202cb-fe74-75ca-b96c-f74fbdbbd5a8/findings/01a202cc-e264-7141-aef7-184d785fce51)",
