        "body": "<!-- proofline:finding-series=01a202cc-e263-7168-a9b8-ff70df385aeb -->\n**Warning** \u00b7 CSV export splits report names containing commas or newlines\n\n`write_export` joins raw field values without CSV quoting or escaping, but `schedule` accepts report names containing commas, newlines, or quotes.\n\nCSV readers can see extra columns, extra rows, or altered field values.\n\nRestore `csv.writer` for the header and rows while keeping cursor iteration.\n\n[View finding in Proofline](https://proofline.sh/orgs/by-id/01a202a0-cd61-7684-99bc-53c775b0de50/reviews/01a202cb-fe74-75ca-b96c-f74fbdbbd5a8/findings/01a202cc-e26b-736d-85bb-652d020288bc)",
